*** Settings ***

Documentation
...   copyright: Nokia Networks
...   author: Rafal Skrok
...   contact: rafal.skrok@nokia.com

...   Provides a framework to run a test case keyword in a loop using the `Template with FOR loop` mechanism.
...   It ensures that when an iteration is unsuccessful, all necessary logs are gathered as configured for the test case.
...
...   This runner utilizes three main dictionaries for configuration, which must be defined in the suite's 'Settings' section:
...
...   1. `ITERATION_SETUP_VARIABLES`:
...      - Purpose: To configure parameters for the `Common Test Setup` keyword, which is executed before each test loop iteration.
...      - Usage: Define this dictionary in the 'Variables' section to pass arguments to `Common Test Setup`.
...        If not defined, `Common Test Setup` is called with its default arguments.
...      NOTE: For a one-time setup before the loop begins (e.g., for commissioning), `Common Test Setup` can be used
...            as a `Test Setup` in the 'Settings' section. This is separate from the setup run for each iteration.
...
...   2. `ITERATION_TEARDOWN_VARIABLES`:
...      - Purpose: To configure parameters for the `Common Test Teardown` keyword, used for log collection after an iteration.
...      - Usage: Define this dictionary in the 'Variables' section to control log collection behavior.
...
...   3. `LOOPED_TEST_VARIABLES`:
...      - Purpose: To pass arguments to the test case keyword that is being executed in a loop.
...      - Usage: Define this dictionary in the 'Variables' section.
...        The keys and values will be passed as arguments to the looped test case keyword.
...
...  NOTE: Separate Teardown keyword `Final Test Loop Teardown` must be used after the loop ends.
...        This keyword collects results, reports iterations to RP and calls the `Common Test Teardown` with all its arguments.
...
...   Example of a looped test case "General_SiSo_Auto_RAT_Reset" defined in the 'Test Cases' section:
...
...       *** Settings ***
...
...       Resource                          taf/rfrl/procedures/SISO/setups_teardowns/SuiteSetupTeardown.robot
...       Resource                          taf/rfrl/procedures/SISO/setups_teardowns/TestSetupTeardown.robot
...       Resource                          taf/rfrl/procedures/SISO/runners/TestLoopRunner.robot
...       Resource                          taf/rfrl/procedures/SISO/General_SiSo_Auto_RAT_Reset.robot
...
...       Suite Setup                       Common Suite Setup                      <--- Mandatory
...
...       Test Setup                        Common Test Setup                       <--- Optional, one-time setup, before the loop begins
...       ...                               custom_scf_name=/home/ute/scf.xml
...
...       Test Teardown                     Final Test Loop Teardown                <--- Mandatory
...       ...                               stop_and_fix_gnb=${True}                <--- Optional teardown arguments
...       ...                               stop_and_fix_enb=${True}
...       ...                               sleeping_cell_test=${True}
...       ...                               power_reset_bts=${False}
...
...       *** Variables ***
...       &{ITERATION_SETUP_VARIABLES}=     ue_reboot=${True}
...
...       &{ITERATION_TEARDOWN_VARIABLES}=  stop_and_fix_gnb=${False}
...                                         stop_and_fix_enb=${False}
...                                         sleeping_cell_test=${False}
...                                         power_reset_bts=${True}
...
...       &{LOOPED_TEST_VARIABLES}=         reset_type=hard
...                                         graceful_cell_shutdown=${True}
...
...        *** Test Cases ***
...
...       General_SiSo_Auto_RAT_Reset
...           [Template]    Execute Test Case In A Loop
...           FOR   ${iteration}    IN RANGE    10    <--- Number of iterations, can be modified
...                 ${iteration}    General_SiSo_Auto_RAT_Reset    ${LOOPED_TEST_VARIABLES}   <--- Template KW Args go here with their order
...           END

Library         taf.sw.reporting_portal

Resource        taf/rfrl/procedures/SISO/setups_teardowns/TestSetupTeardown.robot
Resource        taf/rfrl/procedures/resources/robot/HWPTA_Logger.robot


*** Keywords ***

Execute Test Case In A Loop
    [Documentation]
    ...    Template keyword for a single loop iteration.
    ...
    ...    ARGS:
    ...    - iteration (str): The current iteration number from the FOR loop.
    ...    - keyword (str): The test case keyword to execute in a loop.
    ...    - looped_keyword_args (dict): Arguments for the looped test case keyword.

    [Arguments]
    ...    ${iteration}
    ...    ${keyword}
    ...    ${looped_keyword_args}=&{EMPTY}

    Set Up Test Iteration              iteration=${iteration}
    ${status}=                         Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                                Run keyword
    ...                                ${keyword}
    ...                                &{looped_keyword_args}
    Tear Down Test Iteration           ${iteration}
    ...                                ${status}


Final Test Loop Teardown
    [Documentation]   Final, summary test loop framework teardown keyword extending, with all parameters, the "Common Test Teardown"
    ...               with providing the final result. It MUST be executed after the 'Execute Test Case In A Loop' is called.
    ...               Note: It may be called in the Settings section as well as a looped test `[Teardown]`.
    ...               ARGS: All "Common Test Teardown" parameters provided as regular "Common Test Teardown" parameters.

    [Arguments]    &{common_test_teardown_args}
    
    Set To Dictionary                 ${common_test_teardown_args}
    ...                               force_logs_collection=${COLLECT}
    Common Test Teardown              &{common_test_teardown_args}
    Log Iteration Results And Set Final Status


Ensure Test Loop Status Variables Are Initialized
    ${is_test_status_available}=               Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                                        Variable Should Exist
    ...                                        ${TEST_STATUS}
    IF    ${is_test_status_available}==${False} 
            Set Test Variable
            ...                                ${TEST_STATUS}
            ...                                None
            Set Test Variable
            ...                                @{TEST_ITERATION_STATUSES}
            ...                                @{EMPTY}
    END

    ${is_setup_variables_dict_provided}=       Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                                        Variable Should Exist
    ...                                        ${ITERATION_SETUP_VARIABLES}
    IF    ${is_setup_variables_dict_provided}==${False}
            Set Test Variable
            ...                                ${ITERATION_SETUP_VARIABLES}
            ...                                &{EMPTY}
    END

    ${is_teardown_variables_dict_provided}=    Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                                        Variable Should Exist
    ...                                        ${ITERATION_TEARDOWN_VARIABLES}
    IF    ${is_teardown_variables_dict_provided}==${False}
            Set Test Variable
            ...                                ${ITERATION_TEARDOWN_VARIABLES}
            ...                                &{EMPTY}
    END


Set Up Test Iteration
    [Arguments]
    ...    ${iteration}

    Ensure Test Loop Status Variables Are Initialized
    ${is_test_setup_executed}=                            Is Test Setup Executed
    IF    ${is_test_setup_executed}==${True}
            ${collect_logs}=                              Is Collection Of Iteration Logs Needed
            Common Test Teardown    
            ...                                           force_logs_collection=${collect_logs}
            ...                                           &{ITERATION_TEARDOWN_VARIABLES}
    END
    Common Test Setup                                     &{ITERATION_SETUP_VARIABLES}
    ...                                                   tc_name=${TEST_NAME}_iteration_${iteration}
    Robot Log Operation                                   Iteration: #${iteration} starts


Tear Down Test Iteration
    [Arguments]    
    ...    ${iteration}
    ...    ${status}

    Robot Log Operation                 Iteration: #${iteration} ends
    IF    ${status}==${True}
            Robot Log Result            Iteration: #${iteration} PASSED
            ...                         to_console=${True}
            ${is_collect_needed}=       Is Collection Of Passing Iteration Logs Needed
    ELSE
            Robot Log Result            Iteration: #${iteration} FAILED
            ...                         to_console=${True}
            ${is_collect_needed}=       Set Variable     ${True}
    END
    Set Global Variable
    ...                                 ${COLLECT}
    ...                                 ${is_collect_needed}
    ${result}=                          Create Dictionary
    ...                                 iteration=${iteration}
    ...                                 status=${status}
    Append To List
    ...                                 ${TEST_ITERATION_STATUSES}
    ...                                 ${result}


Log Iteration Results And Set Final Status
    ${any_failed}=                  Set Variable
    ...                             ${False}

    FOR    ${result}    IN    @{TEST_ITERATION_STATUSES}
        IF    ${result.status}==${False}
                Robot Log Warning   Iteration ${result.iteration}: FAILED!
                ${any_failed}=      Set Variable    
                ...                 ${True}
        END
    END
    ${nr_of_executed_loops}=        Get Length
    ...                             ${TEST_ITERATION_STATUSES}
    Add To Test Data                data={"test_loops": ${nr_of_executed_loops}}

    IF    ${any_failed}
            Fail                    One or more iterations failed, final test status: Failed.
    END


Is Collection Of Iteration Logs Needed
    ${does_collect_exist}=          Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                             Variable Should Exist
    ...                             ${COLLECT}
    IF     ${does_collect_exist}
            Robot Log Env State     Does 'collect' variable exist: ${does_collect_exist} - logs collection for iteration: ${COLLECT}.
    ELSE
            Robot Log Env State     Does 'collect' variable exist: ${does_collect_exist} - logs collection not needed yet.
            Set Global Variable     ${COLLECT}
            ...                     ${False}
    END
    [Return]                        ${COLLECT}


Is Test Setup Executed
    ${test_variable_exists}=        Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                             Variable Should Exist
    ...                             ${TEST_SETUP_EXECUTED}
    [Return]                        ${test_variable_exists}


Is Collection Of Passing Iteration Logs Needed
    ${are_logs_collected}=          Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                             Variable Should Exist
    ...                             ${LOGS_COLLECTED}
    Set Global Variable             ${LOGS_COLLECTED}
    ...                             ${are_logs_collected}
    ${not_collected}=               Evaluate
    ...                             not ${are_logs_collected}
    [Return]                        ${not_collected}
